        "language": "modern_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "⑥《剥》卦的“烂”，“烂”指烂熟。《韩注》解释说：“事物成熟后就会剥落。”",
        "confidence": "high",
